OL,3,AOnly one female scientist named in
OL,4,AGCSEs, research finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosalind Franklin is the only female
OL,7,Fscientist named in GCSE and National 5
OL,8,Fscience exam specifications in the UK,
OL,9,Faccording to new research.
OL,11,FA Cambridge study found that of the 86
OL,12,Fscientists named by UK exam boards, the
OL,13,FEnglish chemist, whose work in the
OL,14,F1950s helped reveal the structure of
OL,15,FDNA, was the only woman.
OL,17,FExam specifications set out the skills
OL,18,Fand knowledge students are expected to
OL,19,Fhave gained by the end of their course
OL,20,Fand how they will be assessed.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
